xample, \"View of a water pump next to a reservoir\" transforms to \"Pump next to reservoir,\" and so on.\n\nThe intent here is to have a set of minimal but effective captions that can capture this video's essence at a high level. Now, I'm focusing on the final formatting. I must ensure the final JSON array strictly adheres to the schema: an array of JSON objects, each with \"start\", \"end\", and \"caption\" keys, all double-quoted, with no comments or control tokens, and a single, parseable array.\n\n\n"}